UAVFF3D main project page

This repository contains the public project-page documentation and overview assets for UAVFF3D.

Companion repositories:
- UAVFF3D-Pipeline: https://github.com/yanxian-ll/UAVFF3D-Pipeline
- uavff3d_evaluate_forward_models: https://github.com/yanxian-ll/uavff3d_evaluate_forward_models

The fine-tuning and evaluation code is based on MapAnything and may integrate additional third-party model code or checkpoints. Those components remain subject to their own licenses and notices.

Dataset files, 3D assets, pretrained checkpoints, and fine-tuned checkpoints may be released under licenses different from the documentation license of this repository.
